    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/6c51ed1de221173aa64c930521019241.poster.avif?t=1754662962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/6c51ed1de221173aa64c930521019241.webm?t=1754662962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/6c51ed1de221173aa64c930521019241.mp4?t=1754662962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late For Work is a short liminal psychological horror game set in the corporate offices of a <strong>completely fictional</strong> AAA game development studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single player unsettling experience navigating a surreal setting to\u00a0<strong>authenticate</strong> your human identity at several terminals whilst avoiding security cameras and <i>the supervisors</i>; AI drones charged with disciplining AWOL workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player vs AI Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration of a Surreal Liminal Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some hand crafted segments, some dungeon generator segments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-Euclidean space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Possibly a short story (still designing)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to keep in touch with me:\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/6c51ed1de221173aa64c930521019241.poster.avif?t=1754662962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/6c51ed1de221173aa64c930521019241.webm?t=1754662962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925940/extras/6c51ed1de221173aa64c930521019241.mp4?t=1754662962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late For Work is a short liminal psychological horror game set in the corporate offices of a <strong>completely fictional</strong> AAA game development studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single player unsettling experience navigating a surreal setting to\u00a0<strong>authenticate</strong> your human identity at several terminals whilst avoiding security cameras and <i>the supervisors</i>; AI drones charged with disciplining AWOL workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player vs AI Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration of a Surreal Liminal Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some hand crafted segments, some dungeon generator segments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-Euclidean space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Possibly a short story (still designing)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to keep in touch with me:\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "A single player liminal horror set in the corporate offices of a completely fictional AAA game development studio. You're late, hide from the AI supervisors and security cameras and authenticate your human identity to gain access to your work station without anyone noticing!",
